  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ef4120e8d7cc4784ba80e7aeb2d6d58d, type: 3}
  m_Name: Huginn_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Repeatable: 0
  Lines:
  - Text: "You come intent to unleash Ragnar\xF6k, Princess of Hel?"
    Speaker: 3
  - Text: Why does everyone speak without a physical presence here? I do not know
      what you are talking about. Also, I am not Hel, though she is my sister.
    Speaker: 1
  - Text: I do not have a satisfactory answer to your first inquiry. I also see you
      truly do not comprehend. Prove your body worthy, and your mind keen in these
      trials, to . Furthermore, you are referred to as Princess of Hel, rather than
      Queen, due to your clear proximity to her.
    Speaker: 3
  - Text: Do you answer every question?
    Speaker: 1
  - Text: If you ask that many, then yes. You have yet to respond to mine; do you
      intend to break Loki free.
    Speaker: 3
  - Text: He is my father, I shall not leave him chained and tortured by the Aesir.
    Speaker: 1
  - Text: "That isn\u2019t a question, but I must allow you to face the first trial.
      I see that it is in your blood to surround yourself by death, Princess."
    Speaker: 3
